<title>USA: New Mexico 360 MW San Juan coal-fired unit back up.</title>
<headline>New Mexico 360 MW San Juan coal-fired unit back up.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 360 megawatt (MW) unit 1 at the San Juan coal-fired plant in New Mexico was back on-line as of early Monday, sources familiar with the plant's operations said.</p>
<p>The unit was shut early Thursday due to ash buildup in its boiler tubes.</p>
<p>The San Juan plant, which is operated by Public Service Co of New Mexico, also has a 350 MW unit and two 540 MW units.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
